## Features

* **Fully local.** No web requests, no API keys.
* **Fuzzy matching.** `pn rdr2` will match Red Dead Redemption 2.
* **Game icons** shown right in the results.
* **All your sources.** Every library Playnite knows about, in one search.
* **Launch or open.** Installed games launch directly; uninstalled games open their Playnite page.
* **Context menu.** Open install folder, copy the game id.
* **Hidden games, opt-in.** Include games hidden in Playnite via a setting.

## Usage

Type `pn` followed by a game name:

```
pn cyber
```

{{ screenshot("screenshot", alt="Playnite results in Flow Launcher") }}

## Installation

### Playnite

The plugin reads the library index written by the
[FlowLauncherExporter](https://github.com/Garulf/FlowLauncherExporter) Playnite extension.
Install it from Playnite's add-on browser (search for "Flow Launcher Exporter"), or open
`playnite://playnite/installaddon/FlowLauncherExporter`. If it's missing, the plugin offers a
one-click install from the search results.

### Flow Launcher

In Flow Launcher, type:

```
pm install playnite
```

{{ screenshot("install", alt="Flow Launcher plugin manager installing Playnite") }}

### Manual installation

Download `Playnite-Plugin-<version>.zip` from the [latest release]({{ project.url }}/releases/latest) and unzip it into
`%appdata%\FlowLauncher\Plugins`, then restart Flow Launcher.

